<description>&lt;p&gt;A drone strike hit a location in South Sudan killing at least 153 people. In Ruweng, attackers killed 169 people including 79 soldiers. UNMISS condemned violence in Mayom County and Governor Madut called for calm after two people were killed in Aweil East. Police recruitment has sparked fears of a clampdown ahead of the first elections, while Uganda defended its military deployment in South Sudan and the government set conditions for Dr. Riek Machar’s return to Juba. The UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQZTBiTHNTMC1HZXR4VmRobC1SaVhWeE1aTk0ydEwtTEtJRXhrNmstdWpJWVBQcy1Lall4UUlpbWkxSE5kSkZtdWFhV1NhdUpEdDJuYkE1VXRDZGVPV3dpbGZNV3kwc21vOTR2S0pxczZRcXJ0TFJiRWk4U0JHUWxwMmc5ejdaVzVXYkZ4c0tKSGNJR25GOFZqZA?oc=5&quot;&gt;dailyasianage.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQZEVtdGNReTFodzlycGNnLW5hSVh3SUdWMlJ0RUlhQ0hGdUR2U2NuUTZyanA1aVlhY1RDX0RkSzB4ZjY0dlR1elJXWGZGZ0lrWEszVGNNTjMydklVZkRSUHprZFBlM1dPYkRSMENhNGtrR0JwSnZvRmlCQVNWUWY2dUZWeTlqaUlsRGhvZzhEOEwySW1aSlFWNFZCcGRBNEtURUtPMi1ZY0RQU2hTUFV0aGp3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ahram Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxQdDFvN0tkT2oxM0Rzc25IQkh2WmgzVVNVN2dwSkZYa0FMeHJTUVVRd0R3Nkl2U1dDOGhxX1duS1l2ZWVuUkFBYVQ1MmV6UFhEWWMzd1JvMW5NWG52cHcyV2lLbm5iMlMyQ0k2Sk9URHZMMTlORmRielNmRFZuNDFiQ2hwLXlBamk1aDNZZG1B?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudans Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt